OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 18, arrested after man
OL,4,Adies in village crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving following a crash in a village.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said a male
OL,11,Fpassenger died when a red Seat Ibiza
OL,12,Fcrashed in Croft Road, Cosby, at 15:00
OL,13,FGMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe driver was taken to hospital with
OL,16,Fminor injuries and has since been
OL,17,Fdischarged, the force added.
OL,19,FFollowing his arrest, the teenager has
OL,20,Fbeen released pending further
OL,21,Finquiries.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
